  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;be the plane passing through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d2ef36a6-d0d1-4926-acbb-df61af36a374.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 196px;\" /></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;,</p><p>So, normal vector to the plane will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now equation of plane will be:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>And given plane passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Hence, equation of plane will be,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now using the formula&nbsp;distance of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from the&nbsp;plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>144</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now again using&nbsp;the distance of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from the plane formula&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>13</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
